    <section id="rd-labs" class="acnn-rdp-sec">
        <div class="acnn-rdp-head reveal"><span class="acnn-about-tag">Laboratories</span><h2>Our Research Laboratories</h2><p>Where materials are prepared, characterised and measured</p></div>
        <div class="acnn-rdp-labs">
            <article class="acnn-rdp-lab reveal">
                <div class="acnn-rdp-lab-txt"><span class="no">01</span><small>High-energy ball milling</small><h3>Materials Preparation Laboratory</h3><p>Superfine food materials, electronics and bio-char materials and similar new functional materials can be prepared here for applications in agriculture, food, electronics and other areas of science and technology.</p><ul class="acnn-rdp-tags"><li>High-energy ball mill</li><li>Superfine powders</li><li>Red turmeric superfine powder</li></ul><div class="acnn-rdp-note"><i class="icon-lightbulb"></i><p>Production of red turmeric superfine powder.</p></div></div>
                <div class="acnn-rdp-lab-ph n3"><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p005_018.jpg" title="Materials Preparation Laboratory"><img src="img/rd/p005_018.jpg" alt="Materials Preparation Laboratory" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p005_019.jpg" title="Materials Preparation Laboratory"><img src="img/rd/p005_019.jpg" alt="Materials Preparation Laboratory" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p005_020.jpg" title="Materials Preparation Laboratory"><img src="img/rd/p005_020.jpg" alt="Materials Preparation Laboratory" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
            </article>
            <article class="acnn-rdp-lab reveal">
                <div class="acnn-rdp-lab-txt"><span class="no">02</span><small>Hydrothermal synthesis &amp; furnace</small><h3>Materials Synthesis Lab-II</h3><p>For different types of composite, engineering and biomaterials, and for the structural features of materials and their applications. Precursors for ceramic engineering nanomaterials are prepared here.</p><ul class="acnn-rdp-tags"><li>Hydrothermal synthesis</li><li>High-temperature furnace</li><li>Ceramic precursors</li></ul></div>
                <div class="acnn-rdp-lab-ph n4"><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p006_025.jpg" title="Materials Synthesis Lab-II"><img src="img/rd/p006_025.jpg" alt="Materials Synthesis Lab-II" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p006_026.jpg" title="Materials Synthesis Lab-II"><img src="img/rd/p006_026.jpg" alt="Materials Synthesis Lab-II" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p006_027.jpg" title="Materials Synthesis Lab-II"><img src="img/rd/p006_027.jpg" alt="Materials Synthesis Lab-II" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p006_030.jpg" title="Materials Synthesis Lab-II"><img src="img/rd/p006_030.jpg" alt="Materials Synthesis Lab-II" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
            </article>
            <article class="acnn-rdp-lab reveal">
                <div class="acnn-rdp-lab-txt"><span class="no">03</span><small>Structural characterization</small><h3>Electron Microscopy Lab</h3><p>For evaluation of grain size, agglomerate size and atomic size, and their interpretation for applications from medicine to electronics.</p><ul class="acnn-rdp-tags"><li>Scanning Electron Microscope</li><li>Atomic Force Microscope</li><li>Scanning Tunneling Microscope</li></ul><div class="acnn-rdp-note"><i class="icon-lightbulb"></i><p>Structural measurement of copper-based Tamra bhasma reveals uniformly sized particles that support its medicinal value and better action on disease treatment. This reminds us how great ancient Indian wisdom was — we should not forget our roots.</p></div></div>
                <div class="acnn-rdp-lab-ph n3"><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p007_031.jpg" title="Electron Microscopy Lab"><img src="img/rd/p007_031.jpg" alt="Electron Microscopy Lab" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p007_032.jpg" title="Electron Microscopy Lab"><img src="img/rd/p007_032.jpg" alt="Electron Microscopy Lab" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph  fit" href="img/rd/p007_033.jpg" title="Electron Microscopy Lab"><img src="img/rd/p007_033.jpg" alt="Electron Microscopy Lab" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
            </article>
            <article class="acnn-rdp-lab reveal">
                <div class="acnn-rdp-lab-txt"><span class="no">04</span><small>XRD &amp; FTIR</small><h3>Structural Characterization Labs</h3><p>Research on ancient Indian wisdom — the effect of moon radiation on the efficacy of medicine — and eco-friendly production of metal or metal-oxide materials for multifunctional uses.</p><ul class="acnn-rdp-tags"><li>X-ray Diffractometer (with temperature variation)</li><li>FTIR spectroscopy</li><li>Make: Bruker, Germany</li></ul></div>
                <div class="acnn-rdp-lab-ph n4"><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p008_034.jpg" title="Structural Characterization Labs"><img src="img/rd/p008_034.jpg" alt="Structural Characterization Labs" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p008_035.jpg" title="Structural Characterization Labs"><img src="img/rd/p008_035.jpg" alt="Structural Characterization Labs" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph  fit" href="img/rd/p008_036.jpg" title="Structural Characterization Labs"><img src="img/rd/p008_036.jpg" alt="Structural Characterization Labs" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph  fit" href="img/rd/p008_039.jpg" title="Structural Characterization Labs"><img src="img/rd/p008_039.jpg" alt="Structural Characterization Labs" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
