            <article class="acnn-rdp-lab reveal">
                <div class="acnn-rdp-lab-txt"><span class="no">06</span><small>Particle size &amp; zeta potential</small><h3>Structural Characterization Laboratory</h3><p>Instrumentation for particle size distribution and determination of zeta potential for stability. NTA analysis gives size distribution and concentration of all types of nanoparticles from 20 nm to 1000 nm in diameter; zeta potential gives particle size, concentration and molecular weight and helps determine the stability of materials.</p><ul class="acnn-rdp-tags"><li>Nanoparticle Tracking Analysis</li><li>Dynamic Light Scattering</li><li>Zeta Potential</li><li>Digital Refractometer</li></ul><div class="acnn-rdp-note"><i class="icon-lightbulb"></i><p>Digital refractometer used for determination of the refractive index of materials for various applications.</p></div></div>
                <div class="acnn-rdp-lab-ph n3"><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p010_046.jpg" title="Structural Characterization Laboratory"><img src="img/rd/p010_046.jpg" alt="Structural Characterization Laboratory" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p010_047.jpg" title="Structural Characterization Laboratory"><img src="img/rd/p010_047.jpg" alt="Structural Characterization Laboratory" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p010_048.jpg" title="Structural Characterization Laboratory"><img src="img/rd/p010_048.jpg" alt="Structural Characterization Laboratory" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
            </article>
            <article class="acnn-rdp-lab reveal">
                <div class="acnn-rdp-lab-txt"><span class="no">07</span><small>Electronic structure &amp; light emission</small><h3>Optical Characterization Research Laboratory</h3><p>For determination of electronic structure and light-emitting behaviour for applications as LEDs and optoelectronic devices.</p><ul class="acnn-rdp-tags"><li>UV-Visible-NIR spectroscopy</li><li>Photoluminescence spectroscopy</li></ul></div>
                <div class="acnn-rdp-lab-ph n4"><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p011_049.jpg" title="Optical Characterization Research Laboratory"><img src="img/rd/p011_049.jpg" alt="Optical Characterization Research Laboratory" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p011_050.jpg" title="Optical Characterization Research Laboratory"><img src="img/rd/p011_050.jpg" alt="Optical Characterization Research Laboratory" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p011_053.jpg" title="Optical Characterization Research Laboratory"><img src="img/rd/p011_053.jpg" alt="Optical Characterization Research Laboratory" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph  fit" href="img/rd/p011_051.jpg" title="Optical Characterization Research Laboratory"><img src="img/rd/p011_051.jpg" alt="Optical Characterization Research Laboratory" loading="lazy" /></a></div>
