            <article class="acnn-rdp-lab reveal">
                <div class="acnn-rdp-lab-txt"><span class="no">09</span><small>Magnetic property measurement</small><h3>Magnetic Research Laboratory</h3><p>For measuring magnetic properties of agriculture-based materials, engineering materials and medicines.</p><ul class="acnn-rdp-tags"><li>Vibrating Sample Magnetometer (VSM)</li></ul><div class="acnn-rdp-note"><i class="icon-lightbulb"></i><p>Magnetic measurement of Cu-based Tamra bhasma shows it is nano-crystalline and superparamagnetic (Hc = 149 Oe, Ms = 1.32 emu/g, Mr = 0.47 emu/g), supporting its medicinal value with magnetic storage devices.</p></div></div>
