    <section id="rd-vision" class="acnn-rdp-sec">
        <div class="acnn-rdp-head reveal"><span class="acnn-about-tag">Vision</span><h2>Science for Society</h2></div>
        <div class="acnn-rdp-quote reveal">
            <a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p020_089.jpg" title="Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam"><img src="img/rd/p020_089.jpg" alt="Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam" loading="lazy" /></a>
            <blockquote>&ldquo;Youth must be made to understand the beauty of doing science, the pleasure of doing science, and the ultimate bliss when results of science make you understand nature, master it, control it, and finally make things that improve the quality of life of humankind.&rdquo;<cite>Advance in Nanotechnology, not only Nanoscience</cite></blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="acnn-rdp-two">
            <article class="acnn-rdp-card reveal"><h3>Scientific values for scientific infrastructure</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>According to Article 51-A (h) of the Indian Constitution, it is the duty of every citizen to develop scientific temper along with humanism and a spirit of inquiry and reform.</li>
                    <li>The Bhagavad Gita also states that world civilisation and societies have risen to a higher level not through mechanical or technological efficiency, but by practising sound moral and ethical values.</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="acnn-rdp-ph2"><a class="acnn-rdp-ph  fit" href="img/rd/p021_090.jpg" title="Ethics in Science &amp; Technology programme"><img src="img/rd/p021_090.jpg" alt="Ethics in Science &amp; Technology programme" loading="lazy" /></a><a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p022_091.jpg" title="There is plenty of room at the bottom"><img src="img/rd/p022_091.jpg" alt="There is plenty of room at the bottom" loading="lazy" /></a></div></article>
            <article class="acnn-rdp-card reveal"><h3>Frontier areas of science</h3>
                <p class="lead">Europe to bet up to &euro;1 billion on quantum technology.</p>
                <p>Two similarly ambitious schemes showering money on a single topic, called Flagship projects, have been underway in the European Union since 2014 &mdash; one focuses on the study of graphene, the other on a computer model of the entire human brain.</p>
                <a class="acnn-rdp-ph " href="img/rd/p019_088.jpg" title="Frontier areas of science — quantum technology"><img src="img/rd/p019_088.jpg" alt="Frontier areas of science — quantum technology" loading="lazy" /></a>
                <p class="quote2">&ldquo;There is plenty of room at the bottom.&rdquo; &mdash; Science &amp; Technology</p></article>
        </div>
    </section>

